{"asset_key":"ep7/env_story_17364030","episode":"ep7","category":"env_story","story_id":"17364030","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1736403001:1":{"text":"ぐ、グウィネス様！？どうして、ここに……？","source_cn":"格、格温妮丝大人？！您、您怎么会在这里？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1519914E64AFA21B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1736403002:1":{"text":"あなたを探しに来たのです。あの見事な剣術は、いったい誰に教わったのですか？","source_cn":"我是专门来找你的。你的剑术非常出色，有人教你吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCCBA33957662A900","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1736403003:1":{"text":"剣術？誰にも教わっていませんが……すべて独学です。","source_cn":"剑术？都是我自己练的……没有人教我。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x51FAB3C4EA210FD8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1736403004:1":{"text":"そうですか……いきなりですが、ロイヤル守備軍の予備隊に入るつもりはありませんか？","source_cn":"辛德瑞拉，你愿意加入皇家守备军预备役吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE59FE65E0E780775","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1736403005:1":{"text":"私はあなたの才能を埋もれさせたくありません。その才能は、より多くの人々を救うために使うべきです！","source_cn":"你的才华不应该被埋没，而应该握剑，去保护更多的人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4971A8AC88759A3D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1736403006:1":{"text":"ロイヤル守備軍……わ、私なんかに務まるのでしょうか？","source_cn":"我……我真的可以吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x44ED44BE58A8D294","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1736403007:1":{"text":"もちろんです！あなたさえ望むなら、私が責任をもって一人前の守備軍になるまで育て上げます！","source_cn":"当然可以！只要你愿意，我会亲自教导你，直到你成为一名合...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x765927C9183D3429","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1736403008:1":{"text":"よ……よろしくお願いします！","source_cn":"我、我愿意！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDD8BCB857F336ADC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:辛德瑞拉":{"text":"シンデレラ","source":"辛德瑞拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:格温妮丝":{"text":"グウィネス","source":"格温妮丝","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":9,"localized_text_count":8,"speaker_count":2}}